From 9084e96117889f19c84d97c2e2a841af639d1c91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:00:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Number/Bar/Pie view toggle to every team member report

Dues, Dealers, Orders and Item-wise sales each get a small three-icon
switcher (# Number, chart-bar Bars, pie-chart Pie) at the top of the
report, defaulting to the plain number list. Bar reuses the charts
already shipped; Pie is a new plain CSS conic-gradient donut plus a
color-swatch legend (no charting library), fed by small per-report
slice builders (top dealers by outstanding for Dues, owner vs granted
for Dealers, order value by dealer for Orders, quantity share for
Item-wise sales) that all fold anything past the top 4 into an
"Others" slice. Every chart component now shows a plain "Nothing to
chart yet" message instead of silently rendering nothing, since
they're reachable directly from the toggle now rather than only
appearing when a parent already knew there was data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
